# AURIX AI Environment & Credential Configuration
# ------------------------------------------------
# AURIX AI uses Firebase AI Logic + Firebase App Check instead of bundling
# a raw Gemini API key in the client APK.
#
# 1. Local / Debug Development:
#    - Provisioned automatically via google-services.json and App Check debug tokens.
#    - Optional debug token injected via launch Intent extra: FIREBASE_APPCHECK_DEBUG_TOKEN
#
# 2. Release Builds:
#    - Configure your reCAPTCHA Enterprise Android key in:
#      app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml (or firebase_applet_config.xml)
#      as <string name="recaptcha_site_key">YOUR_KEY</string>
#
# Never commit google-services.json private secrets, keystores, or API keys
# to public repositories.
